    "H3": "A closure deficit is identifiable only at a rung where matched same-partition Richards is numerically qualified and reaches the frozen comparator while Layer-ROM at that exact partition does not.",
    "H4": "If Layer-ROM and same-partition Richards both miss at a rung, the remaining limitation cannot be assigned to Layer-ROM closure.",
    "H5": "If the terminal 16-state rung remains below the comparator for both Layer-ROM and same-partition Richards, P4 stops without adding states."
